        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.562,
            0.046,
            0.848,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": "Expressions Using Letter-Numbers"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.087,
            0.849,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "6. A local train from Yahapur to Vahapur stops at three stations at equal distances along the way. The time taken in minutes to travel from one station to the next station is the same and is denoted by t. The train stops for 2 minutes at each of the three stations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.167,
            0.848,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": "(a) If t = 4, what is the time taken to travel from Yahapur to Vahapur?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.209,
            0.849,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": "(b) What is the algebraic expression for the time taken to travel from Yahapur to Vahapur? [Hint: Draw a rough diagram to visualise the situation]"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.27,
            0.543,
            0.292
          ],
          "content": "7. Simplify the following expressions:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.294,
            0.545,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": "(a) $3a+9b-6+8a-4b-7a+16$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.318,
            0.498,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": "(b) 3 $( 3 a - 3 b ) - 8 a - 4 b - 1 6$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.341,
            0.443,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": "(c) 2 $( 2 x - 3 ) + 8 x + 1 2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.366,
            0.425,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": "(d) 8x – (2x – 3) + 12"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.39,
            0.417,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": "(e) 8h – (5 + 7h) + 9"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.414,
            0.552,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": "(f) $2 3 + 4 ( 6 m - 3 n ) - 8 n - 3 m - 1 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.438,
            0.529,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": "8. Add the expressions given below:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.463,
            0.528,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": "(a) 4d – 7c + 9 and 8c – 11 + 9d"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.486,
            0.585,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": "(b) – 6f + 19 – 8s and – 23 + 13f + 12s"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.511,
            0.562,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": "(c) 8d – 14c + 9 and 16c – (11 + 9d)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.534,
            0.549,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": "(d) 6f – 20 + 8s and 23 – 13f – 12s"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.559,
            0.512,
            0.581
          ],
          "content": "(e) 13m – 12n and 12n – 13m"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.582,
            0.531,
            0.604
          ],
          "content": "(f) – 26m + 24n and 26m – 24n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.607,
            0.57,
            0.629
          ],
          "content": "9. Subtract the expressions given below:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.631,
            0.552,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": "(a) 9a – 6b + 14 from 6a + 9b – 18"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.655,
            0.573,
            0.677
          ],
          "content": "(b) – 15x + 13 – 9y from 7y – 10 + 3x"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.679,
            0.563,
